    <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
      <body>
        <div rend="parallel">
            <p xml:id="Aink452-kilavi">kuṟitta paruvattu vārātu talaimakaṉ pakaimēl muyalkiṉṟa muyaṟci kēṭṭa talaimakaḷ kūṟiyatu.</p>
            <p xml:lang="en">[The hero] not having come at the indicated season, the heroine, who had heard of the effort the hero is making again the enemy, declared [this].</p>
              </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
          <lg xml:id="Aink452">        
            <l>vaṟanta ñālan teḷirppa vīcik</l>
            <l>kaṟaṅkukura leḻili kārcey taṉṟē</l>
            <l>pakaiveṅ kātalar tiṟaitaru muyaṟci</l>
            <l>meṉṟō ḷāykaviṉ maṟaiyap</l>
            <l>poṉpuṉai pīrat talarcey taṉṟē.</l>
        </lg>  
 <lg xml:lang="en">                    
<l>Hurling it down so the parched ground flourishes,</l>
<l>the cloud of rumbling noise has made the rainy season.</l>
<l>The effort of the beloved, fierce to enemies, that brings tribute,</l>
<l>so that the choice beauty of my soft shoulders vanishes,</l>
<l>has made it spread like the gold-adorned Piram creepers.<note xml:lang="en" place="foot">I think this must be an elliptical refernce to the lovesick pallor that appears when a woman's lover is away.</note></l> 
</lg>                      
        </div>
      </body>
    </text>
